,,,,,,,,"800","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D03AQH2faNHe3XxCw/profile-displayphoto-crop_800_800/B4DaAzcdlrKcAM-/0/1787569497770?e=1795651200&v=beta&t=BSdX2vzxZWDnNhduv7LKcinkzYF2Ih130ZTgT41XBQA","800",,"ACoAAAFZEGwBbbAQ9k09BIbYJb-SL0H10pcfUxk","Presidente da Ipiranga","https://www.linkedin.com/in/leonardolinden?miniProfileUrn=urn%3Ali%3Afsd_profile%3AACoAAAFZEGwBbbAQ9k09BIbYJb-SL0H10pcfUxk","Leonardo Linden","ACoAAAFZEGwBbbAQ9k09BIbYJb-SL0H10pcfUxk","leonardolinden","profile",,"22614124",,,"Obrigado à S&P Global Energy pelo convite para participar desse importante debate sobre os desafios da cadeia de suprimentos de combustíveis no Brasil.

O cenário de suprimento global vem sendo desafiado pelos eventos no Oriente Médio. A quebra de cadência atrapalha mais do que a volatilidade dos custos, e se reflete de forma mais direta na logística de distribuição. 

Na Ipiranga, aumentamos nossa importação, criamos opções e ajustamos nossa operação para que pudéssemos manter o abastecimento regular aos nossos clientes, buscando sempre o máximo de eficiência. 

Neste painel, falamos sobre este desafio, e também sobre infraestrutura, competitividade e eficiência como pilares para o desenvolvimento do setor, além da importância do combate ao mercado ilegal, uma agenda em que distribuidoras, reguladores e demais agentes públicos têm sido cada vez mais vocais para fortalecer o mercado regular e beneficiar o consumidor.","13998","https://www.linkedin.com/company/petroleo-ipiranga/","Ipiranga","https://www.linkedin.com/company/petroleo-ipiranga/","8",,,,,,"375",,"COMPANY_NAME",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,"4","7490513542614429696","264","239","LIKE","22","PRAISE","2","INTEREST","1","EMPATHY",,,,,"1","7490513542614429696",,,,,,,"7490513542614429696","https://www.linkedin.com/posts/leonardolinden_obrigado-%C3%A0-sp-global-energy-pelo-convite-activity-7490513542614429696-N13z","1706","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D22AQFTZCJRO_GWnQ/feedshare-shrink_1280/B4DZ_OmX4hJMAQ-/0/1785877594024?e=1795651200&v=beta&t=J6rR8wv4bi3y1Vij7gOwr7REcomXbTfSfiVwQcbFdb0","1280",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,"2026-08-04T21:06:35.571Z","3mo","3 months ago • Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn","1785877595571","1",,"ee883d1e-e029-48a6-8a43-d368e47904ab","date","https://www.linkedin.com/in/leonardolinden/?locale=pt",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:share:7490513541305733120","urn:li:share:7490513541305733120","true","true","https://www.linkedin.com/posts/leonardolinden_obrigado-%C3%A0-sp-global-energy-pelo-convite-activity-7490513542614429696-N13z?",,"post"
