v2/D4D22AQFL_d_hX2bDow/feedshare-shrink_1280/B4DZlzj56TJEAs-/0/1758580416850?e=1795651200&v=beta&t=E6S2GDyyyQKuNY6N_h4oHIHbvZKhZ_ISZQobvCDZ1mc","1024","1280","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D22AQEqP-U0zw4w6g/feedshare-image-high-res/B4DZlzj57NJEAs-/0/1758580417054?e=1795651200&v=beta&t=KyRh0A-xJ8gBFX8B43uZ6wtERFL7XgdpW3rik6kR5Go","1024",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,"2025-09-22T22:33:39.208Z","1yr","1 year ago • Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn","1758580419208","1",,"ee883d1e-e029-48a6-8a43-d368e47904ab","date","https://www.linkedin.com/in/leonardolinden/?locale=pt",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:ugcPost:7376020885465423872","urn:li:ugcPost:7376020885465423872","true","true","https://www.linkedin.com/posts/leonardolinden_ultrapar-grupoultra-ipiranga-activity-7376020886606299136-Pc0j?",,"post"
,,,,,,,,"800","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D03AQH2faNHe3XxCw/profile-displayphoto-crop_800_800/B4DaAzcdlrKcAM-/0/1787569497770?e=1795651200&v=beta&t=BSdX2vzxZWDnNhduv7LKcinkzYF2Ih130ZTgT41XBQA","800",,"ACoAAAFZEGwBbbAQ9k09BIbYJb-SL0H10pcfUxk","Presidente da Ipiranga","https://www.linkedin.com/in/leonardolinden?miniProfileUrn=urn%3Ali%3Afsd_profile%3AACoAAAFZEGwBbbAQ9k09BIbYJb-SL0H10pcfUxk","Leonardo Linden","ACoAAAFZEGwBbbAQ9k09BIbYJb-SL0H10pcfUxk","leonardolinden","profile",,"22614124",,,"Que dia importante!!! Há muito tempo esperávamos uma ação como esta. É triste demais olhar um setor como um todo ser penalizado por ações do crime organizado. Distribuidoras e Revendedores sérios, que investem pesado no país, vinham pagando um preço muito caro, por muito tempo. 

Mas a ação firme do MP Federal e Estaduais, junto com as Polícias Federal, Civil e Militar, Secretarias da Fazenda, PGE SP e a ANP, entre outros, renovam nossas esperanças de que este problema tem solução. Sempre acreditei que o país não abandonaria um setor que arrecada quase R$200Bi em tributos, é responsável por quase 10% do PIB nacional e é tão importante na vida dos brasileiros. Estou aqui, assistindo a toda esta movimentação, com a sensação de estarmos sendo recompensados por tanta resiliência. Nunca, por um segundo, questionei nosso respeito às regras regulatórias e tributárias, e estar junto de uma marca que há quase 90 anos põe os mesmos valores em prática, é gratificante.

Parabéns aos órgãos envolvidos, aos Revendedores Ipiranga que igualmente se mantêm íntegros, mesmo tendo, muitas vezes, a percepção de que isto jamais teria solução!","13998","https://www.linkedin.com/company/petroleo-ipiranga/","Ipiranga","https://www.linkedin.com/company/petroleo-ipiranga/","8",,,,,,"1022",,"COMPANY_NAME",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,"13","7366937508737212418","466","392","LIKE","43","PRAISE","19","EMPATHY","12","APPRECIATION",,,,,"22","7366937568216616961",,,,,,,"7366937568216616961","https://www.linkedin.com/posts/leonardolinden_que-dia-importante-h%C3%A1-muito-tempo-esper%C3%A1vamos-activity-7366937568216616961-0zM6",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D05AQGgtCvTitqnvA/videocover-low/B4DZjyeoWXHsCE-/0/1756414780582?e=1794844800&v=beta&t=tJBduQ3xgcoOxqcpFJIiqPtykikGk3MKYEciaKbtI9k","https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/dynamic/D4D05AQGgtCvTitqnvA/CeJxzMnGJyqpMzQ-P8Ch2ddTVcULiuySj8dNR-a6uaHxPXQD_yBmL?e=1794844800&v=beta&t=Qb1LxsuWJlD7CQXunzaQnZQ4muDdHOLnGVHpMZEe4yM","2025-08-28T20:59:47.344Z","1yr","1 year ago • Edited • Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn","1756414787344","1",,"ee883d1e-e029-48a6-8a43-d368e47904ab","date","https://www.linkedin.com/in/leonardolinden/?locale=pt",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:ugcPost:7366937508737212418","urn:li:ugcPost:7366937508737212418","true","true","https://www.linkedin.com/posts/leonardolinden_que-dia-importante-h%C3%A1-muito-tempo-esper%C3%A1vamos-activity-7366937568216616961-0zM6?",,"post"
