,,,,,,,,"800","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D03AQH2faNHe3XxCw/profile-displayphoto-crop_800_800/B4DaAzcdlrKcAM-/0/1787569497770?e=1795651200&v=beta&t=BSdX2vzxZWDnNhduv7LKcinkzYF2Ih130ZTgT41XBQA","800",,"ACoAAAFZEGwBbbAQ9k09BIbYJb-SL0H10pcfUxk","Presidente da Ipiranga","https://www.linkedin.com/in/leonardolinden?miniProfileUrn=urn%3Ali%3Afsd_profile%3AACoAAAFZEGwBbbAQ9k09BIbYJb-SL0H10pcfUxk","Leonardo Linden","ACoAAAFZEGwBbbAQ9k09BIbYJb-SL0H10pcfUxk","leonardolinden","profile",,"22614124",,,"Ontem vários agentes importantes do setor se reuniram para o lançamento do “Movimento Unidos pelo Combustível Legal”.  Fundamental podermos contar com o Instituto Combustivel Legal - ICL, a Fecombustíveis, o Sindicom e a Brasilcom para instalação de um observatório nacional de combustíveis visando o monitoramento permanente do mercado para combate às práticas irregulares.

A distribuição de combustíveis é um serviço essencial para abastecimento do País, responsável por prover a infraestrutura para funcionamento de inúmeros setores da indústria e é preocupante vermos essa cadeia ser utilizada por grupos para sonegação e enriquecimento ilícito. 

A união entre Revendedores, Distribuidores e autoridades em torno de uma pauta de combate a irregularidades é fundamental para que se sustentem as regras de negócio, preserve-se a arrecadação de estados e união, e haja incentivo a investimentos e à concorrência leal.",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,"4","7235059046754512896","329","285","LIKE","29","PRAISE","8","EMPATHY","4","APPRECIATION","3","INTEREST",,,"2","7235059046754512896",,,,,,,"7235059046754512896","https://www.linkedin.com/posts/leonardolinden_ontem-v%C3%A1rios-agentes-importantes-do-setor-activity-7235059046754512896-3YoN","1440","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D22AQFzhDVlS2O8dw/feedshare-image-high-res/feedshare-image-high-res/0/1724972496792?e=1795651200&v=beta&t=-22FE_tHzLvePkcRFsEIE1yeYP5w86K-3emp49TdYg4","1440",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,"2024-08-29T23:01:37.643Z","2yr","2 years ago • Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn","1724972497643","1",,"ee883d1e-e029-48a6-8a43-d368e47904ab","date","https://www.linkedin.com/in/leonardolinden/?locale=pt",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:share:7235059045903069184","urn:li:share:7235059045903069184","true","true","https://www.linkedin.com/posts/leonardolinden_ontem-v%C3%A1rios-agentes-importantes-do-setor-activity-7235059046754512896-3YoN?",,"post"
