sos colaboradores, fornecedores e parceiros pelo trabalho incansável. 

-

We’re proud to announce that Ipiranga and Ultra Group are now part of the CCPS (Center for Chemical Process Safety), the largest and most important safety process organization in the world. This achievement is a historical milestone for us as it recognizes our efforts in ESG, and highlights Ipiranga as the first distributor, as well as one of the first Brazilian companies to join. We’d like to thank the CCPS for their confidence in us, and are excited about the beginning of this partnership. Lastly, we’d like to extend a big thank you to our employees, suppliers and partners for their tireless work.",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,"18","7116053736413626368","826","687","LIKE","73","PRAISE","60","EMPATHY","4","INTEREST","2","APPRECIATION",,,"41","7116053736413626368",,"7116053736413626368","https://www.linkedin.com/posts/petroleo-ipiranga_%C3%A9-com-muito-orgulho-que-anunciamos-que-a-activity-7116053736413626368--J41","1080","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D22AQGCQhmO_CaGng/feedshare-image-high-res/feedshare-image-high-res/0/1696599419870?e=1795651200&v=beta&t=2aIAUMtJSn9FvY-5JZJB1yoSKQX9Yfq2I9edc1XJ7Zo","1080",,,,,,,,,,,,"2023-10-06T13:37:00.646Z","3yr","3 years ago • Visible to anyone on or off LinkedIn","1696599420646","https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:share:7116053735650304000","urn:li:share:7116053735650304000",,,"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/petroleo-ipiranga_%C3%A9-com-muito-orgulho-que-anunciamos-que-a-activity-7116053736413626368--J41?",,"7116053736413626368",,,,,,,"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:share:7118008658222809090","urn:li:share:7118008658222809090",,,"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/leonardolinden_%C3%A9-com-muito-orgulho-que-anunciamos-que-a-activity-7118008658772307968-ZYO5?",,"post"
